{"unit_id": "zhukeu2-lang__dsh-takeover#feature-1", "repo": "zhukeu2-lang/dsh-takeover", "commit": "5e4a5b2102569f64920cef4afb92e8a80589eb35", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-takeover 的功能「会话移交」：在会话右键菜单打开移交弹窗，选择旧会话、新会话模式和读取方式；插件创建或打开新会话，并预填交接提示。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:862-899", "lib/client.js:1729-1738"]}
