{"unit_id": "zhukeu2-lang__dsh-takeover#caveat-1", "repo": "zhukeu2-lang/dsh-takeover", "commit": "5e4a5b2102569f64920cef4afb92e8a80589eb35", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-takeover 将交接记录和 Markdown 文档写入会话工作区的“AI工作区/交接”目录，清理选项另存于浏览器 localStorage；文件操作由 DSH 主进程处理。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:51-58", "lib/client.js:462-480"]}
